5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know how much work the treasurer has to do. I'll check the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the sign-up records for mid-year joiners.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need a clear picture of the money. I'll look into last year's ledger of outgoings and the bank statements on last year's renewals.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I'm concerned about how people feel. I'll check the minute books from the named-grade years and the taster evening forms from non-joiners.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I've noticed people are hesitant lately. I'll look at the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I want to see who is actually doing the work. I'll check the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
